lijven hem eveneens beïnvloeden. Thomas Hardy volgt hoe een zorgvuldig opgebouwde positie kwetsbaar wordt wanneer eerdere daden opnieuw betekenis krijgen. De roman speelt in Wessex, een fictieve streek die sterk met het landelijke Engeland is verbonden.","work_id":987110005,"evidence":[{"note":"Hardy MayorofCasterbridge. KB explicitly binds long bibliographic title to shortened front title; one novel, no duplicate Work. Exact current source-edition key is already present; fill its absent ISBN from bound independent KB records, never insert a duplicate edition. Only Pijpelijntjes additionally needs NULL-language→dut based on exact KB language evidence.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801738113"],"reference":"work:1483","checked_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:00.000Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-026.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8193406W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801738113"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"efea9b4443c9fcfa3ebf2853c668309a6cc4966406faa297b20e280f60ead6d1","cover_id":6582601,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-003.jpg. Thomas Hardy; De burgemeester van Casterbridge; Kramers Klassieken. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8193406W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T19:45:00+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-011","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987310003},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987210008},"seq":15,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover